"seeds, and 1/4 to Cloudflare official range exploration. Missing pools flow "
"to other sources. All candidates are deduplicated and measured locally in "
"one CFST run; community ports are never reused."
msgstr ""
"每次运行大致将 1/8 分配给新的历史优选项，5/8 分配给社区种子，1/4 用于 "
"Cloudflare 官方网段探索。来源不足时，额度会流向其他来源。所有候选会去重，并在"
"一次 CFST 运行中本地测量；不会复用社区来源中的端口。"

